  "translation": "On Sunday, I went to the supermarket with my mom. We first went to the fruit section. The fruit was very cheap. We bought three red apples. Mom also bought a cup of milk tea. There were many people in the supermarket. I often come to this supermarket. We all like it here. Mom asked me, \"What do you want to drink? Milk or water?\" I said, \"I want to drink water.\" I drank a cup of water. Today I don't have school. We walked home slowly. After returning home, I helped mom cook. Mom can cook. I ate the food mom cooked. Today was really happy."
